ler ridge (1,925 m, Berggasthaus Schaefler ~1h20 from Ebenalp) anchors multi-day Alpstein hut-to-hut treks; St. Gallen Abbey + Stiftsbibliothek (UNESCO 1983, ~160,000 volumes) a 37-min culture pairing","Culinary depth beyond cheese: Appenzeller Biber gingerbread + Brauerei Locher (Locher family since 1886, Quoellfrisch, ~40 beers); folk-art heritage (Bauernmalerei, Streichmusik) at Museum Appenzell + Brauchtumsmuseum Urnaesch"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 117 police / 118 fire / 144 ambulance / 1414 REGA alpine air-rescue / 145 poison","hospital":"Spital Appenzell (local); Kantonsspital St. Gallen (~25 km, trauma); Alpstein incidents via REGA air-rescue","advisory_level":"L1","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"Alpstein hiking: exposed Ebenalp/Aescher cliff path with steep drops + unlit cave passage (bring light), fast-changing mountain weather, sure-footed sections; Alpabfahrt = live cattle with heavy bells on the street; REGA 1414","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/switzerland","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:23:45+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Summer weekends (Jul-Aug) for Alpstein hiking + folklore set-pieces (Landsgemeinde late Apr, Alpabfahrt late Aug-Sep)","shoulder":"May-Jun + Sep-Oct (fine hiking, autumn descent, thinner midweek)","green":"Nov-Mar (village + cheese + traditions; some huts/cableway closed; Aescher seasonal) — lowest rates","booking_lead":"day-trips little lead; Landsgemeinde Sun + peak Alpabfahrt weekends tighten lodging (1-3 mo); Aescher/huts book ahead for summer overnights","off_season_specials":"winter village-culture + cheese + Christmas-tradition breaks; snowshoe days","event_peaks":"Landsgemeinde (last Sun Apr — 26 Apr 2026), Alpaufzug/Alpabfahrt (up ~May, down late Aug-Sep), hiking season May-Oct, Silvesterchlausen (New Year mummers)","campaign_start":"summer hiking + Alpabfahrt by late winter/spring; Landsgemeinde as bucket-list April date mo