-See-Kaprun, Salzburg","Live Entertainment engine: Salzburg Festival + Vienna balls/New Year''s Concert + Bregenz Festival (world''s largest floating stage, ~200,000/yr) + Christmas markets (Vienna Rathausplatz ~2.8M)","Wine country: Grüner Veltliner + Riesling across Wachau/Kamptal/Kremstal (Danube), Burgenland (Neusiedl reds), Styria (Sauvignon/Schilcher); Vienna = world classical-music heartland"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 133 police / 144 ambulance / 122 fire / 1450 medical; Bergrettung 140","hospital":"per city (Vienna AKH; Salzburg Uniklinikum; Innsbruck Universitatsklinik; Graz LKH-Univ. Klinikum)","advisory_level":"L1","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","note":"alpine avalanche/altitude spine in the mountain satellites; cities + Styria + Wachau low-risk; heli-ski restricted","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/austria","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:19:06+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Jul-Aug (Alps + Salzburg Festival) + December (markets) + Jan-Feb (Vienna balls + ski)","shoulder":"May-Jun + Sep","green":"Nov + Mar-Apr (ex-ski tail)","booking_lead":"Festival/summer 6-12 mo; ski 3-6 mo; markets 3-4 mo; Opera Ball 6-12 mo; Styria/shoulder 1-2 mo","off_season_specials":"Nov + shoulder city-breaks + Styrian thermal-spa + rail city-hops","event_peaks":"Salzburg Festival (Jul-Aug), Vienna balls + NY Concert (Jan-Feb), Christmas markets (Nov-Dec), ski (Dec-Apr), wine harvest (Sep-Oct)","campaign_start":"ski Aug-Sep; Salzburg Festival Oct-Nov prior; markets early Sep; year-round Austria-by-rail"},"jewels":[{"name":"Graz — Schlossberg + the Kunsthaus + old town","si_tag":"Culture & Heritage","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~€0-30/pp (approx)","timing":"standing; best May-Oct","draw_rank":1,"hook":"Austria''s second city, a UNESCO old town under the clock-tower Schlossberg, the \"friendly alien\" Kunsthaus and the island-in-the-Mur","si":"culture","blurb":"Austria''s secon